1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,986
Going the other way, every family of curves has a differential equation.

2
00:00:04,986 --> 00:00:19,466
The circles x squared plus y squared equals a squared, for every radius a. Differentiate once, because there is one constant, and a disappears: d y by d x equals minus x over y.

3
00:00:19,466 --> 00:00:23,151
One equation describes every circle in the family.

